{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22701","headline":"村居寄张殷衡 · 白居易","name":"村居寄张殷衡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金氏村中一病夫，生涯濩落性灵迂。\n唯看老子五千字，不蹋长安十二衢。\n药铫夜倾残酒煖，竹牀寒取旧毡铺。\n闻君欲发江东去，能到茅庵访别无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22701.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22701","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}